{"id":"bfb655edc00393b82b38c0e984bfdae49158a0f9","url":"https://github.com/f/prompts.chat","title":"GitHub - f/prompts.chat: f.k.a. Awesome ChatGPT Prompts. Share, discover, and collect prompts from the community. Free and open source — self-host for your organization with complete privacy.","site_name":"TopHub","source":"GitHub · Trending Today","byline":null,"excerpt":"f.k.a. Awesome ChatGPT Prompts. Share, discover, and collect prompts from the community. Free and open source — self-host for your organization with complete privacy. - f/prompts.chat","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div data-hpc=\"true\" containertiming=\"hpc\"><article itemprop=\"text\">\n<p dir=\"auto\">\n  <strong>The world's largest open-source prompt library for AI</strong><br>\n  <sub>Works with ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Llama, Mistral, and more</sub>\n</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\n  <sub>formerly known as Awesome ChatGPT Prompts</sub>\n</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\n  <a href=\"https://prompts.chat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/6d224fb190943a3370370b00dc8a45e4a453a0dc6c7298fb8e01f020a4900d77/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f576562736974652d70726f6d7074732e636861742d626c75653f7374796c653d666c61742d737175617265\" alt=\"Website\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Website-prompts.chat-blue?style=flat-square\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/awesome\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/2727609d8bfde9ba1a95be1449eb878bfafa4d76789ba05661857e2c8ac70fa1/68747470733a2f2f63646e2e7261776769742e636f6d2f73696e647265736f726875732f617765736f6d652f643733303566333864323966656437386661383536353265336136336531353464643865383832392f6d656469612f62616467652e737667\" alt=\"Awesome\" data-canonical-src=\"https://cdn.rawgit.com/sindresorhus/awesome/d7305f38d29fed78fa85652e3a63e154dd8e8829/media/badge.svg\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/fka/prompts.chat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d505c7f3038232a64d9a86a08b1821062924d91cdbe7a913f152131ab6871c0b/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652ff09fa4972d48756767696e675f466163652d79656c6c6f773f7374796c653d666c61742d737175617265\" alt=\"Hugging Face\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/🤗-Hugging_Face-yellow?style=flat-square\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://deepwiki.com/f/prompts.chat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/0f5ae213ac378635adeb5d7f13cef055ad2f7d9a47b36de7b1c67dbe09f609ca/68747470733a2f2f6465657077696b692e636f6d2f62616467652e737667\" alt=\"Ask DeepWiki\" data-canonical-src=\"https://deepwiki.com/badge.svg\"></a>\n</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\n  <a href=\"https://prompts.chat/prompts\" rel=\"nofollow\">🌐 Browse Prompts</a> •\n  <a href=\"https://fka.gumroad.com/l/art-of-chatgpt-prompting\" rel=\"nofollow\">📖 Read the Book</a> •\n  <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/PROMPTS.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">📄 View on GitHub</a> •\n  <a href=\"#-self-hosting\">🚀 Self-Host</a>\n</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\n  <sub>\n    🏆 Featured in <a href=\"https://www.forbes.com/sites/tjmccue/2023/01/19/chatgpt-success-completely-depends-on-your-prompt/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forbes</a> ·\n    🎓 Referenced by <a href=\"https://www.huit.harvard.edu/news/ai-prompts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Harvard</a>, <a href=\"https://etc.cuit.columbia.edu/news/columbia-prompt-library-effective-academic-ai-use\" rel=\"nofollow\">Columbia</a> ·\n    📄 <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=AZ0Dg8YAAAAJ&hl=en\" rel=\"nofollow\">40+ academic citations</a> ·\n    ❤️ <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/fka/prompts.chat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Most liked dataset</a> on Hugging Face<br>\n    ⭐ 143k+ GitHub stars ·\n    🏅 <a href=\"https://spotlights-feed.github.com/spotlights/prompts-chat/index/\">GitHub Staff Pick</a> ·\n    🚀 First prompt library (Dec 2022)\n  </sub>\n</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\n  <sub><strong>Loved by AI pioneers:</strong></sub><br>\n  <sub>\n    <a href=\"https://x.com/gdb/status/1602072566671110144\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Greg Brockman</strong></a> (OpenAI Co-Founder) ·\n    <a href=\"https://x.com/woj_zaremba/status/1601362952841760769\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Wojciech Zaremba</strong></a> (OpenAI Co-Founder) ·\n    <a href=\"https://x.com/clementdelangue/status/1830976369389642059\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Clement Delangue</strong></a> (Hugging Face CEO) ·\n    <a href=\"https://x.com/ashtom/status/1887250944427237816\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Thomas Dohmke</strong></a> (Former GitHub CEO)\n  </sub>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<P dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">What is this?</h2><a id=\"user-content-what-is-this\" aria-label=\"Permalink: What is this?\" href=\"#what-is-this\"></a></P>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A curated collection of <strong>prompts</strong> for AI chat models. Originally created for ChatGPT, these prompts work great with any modern AI assistant.</p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Browse Prompts</th>\n<th>Data Formats</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://prompts.chat/prompts\" rel=\"nofollow\">prompts.chat</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/prompts.csv\">prompts.csv</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/PROMPTS.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">PROMPTS.md</a></td>\n<td><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/fka/prompts.chat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hugging Face Dataset</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Want to contribute?</strong> Add prompts at <a href=\"https://prompts.chat/prompts/new\" rel=\"nofollow\">prompts.chat/prompts/new</a> — they sync here automatically.</p>\n<hr>\n<P dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">📖 The Interactive Book of Prompting</h2><a id=\"user-content--the-interactive-book-of-prompting\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 📖 The Interactive Book of Prompting\" href=\"#-the-interactive-book-of-prompting\"></a></P>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Learn prompt engineering with our <strong>free, interactive guide</strong> — 25+ chapters covering everything from basics to advanced techniques like chain-of-thought reasoning, few-shot learning, and AI agents.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong><a href=\"https://fka.gumroad.com/l/art-of-chatgpt-prompting\" rel=\"nofollow\">Start Reading →</a></strong> (Source: <a href=\"https://github.com/f/prompts.chat/tree/main/src/content/book\">https://github.com/f/prompts.chat/tree/main/src/content/book</a>)</p>\n<hr>\n<P dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">🎮 Prompting for Kids</h2><a id=\"user-content--prompting-for-kids\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🎮 Prompting for Kids\" href=\"#-prompting-for-kids\"></a></P>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\n  <a href=\"https://prompts.chat/kids\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/38cd8206b43f9f14da823fb5fd45778bd888034c9781acd4d6a98cf69d2e0942/68747470733a2f2f70726f6d7074732e636861742f70726f6d692d6461726b2e737667\" data-canonical-src=\"https://prompts.chat/promi-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/143e166576e09647ecd41e1c79ed2df3e70347b7a14f747cb8ed82e2604efcd0/68747470733a2f2f70726f6d7074732e636861742f70726f6d692e737667\" data-canonical-src=\"https://prompts.chat/promi.svg\">\n      <img height=\"60\" alt=\"Promi\" src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/143e166576e09647ecd41e1c79ed2df3e70347b7a14f747cb8ed82e2604efcd0/68747470733a2f2f70726f6d7074732e636861742f70726f6d692e737667\" data-canonical-src=\"https://prompts.chat/promi.svg\">\n    </picture></themed-picture>\n  </a>\n</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">An interactive, game-based adventure to teach children (ages 8-14) how to communicate with AI through fun puzzles and stories.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong><a href=\"https://prompts.chat/kids\" rel=\"nofollow\">Start Playing →</a></strong></p>\n<br clear=\"left\">\n<hr>\n<P dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">🚀 Self-Hosting</h2><a id=\"user-content--self-hosting\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🚀 Self-Hosting\" href=\"#-self-hosting\"></a></P>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Deploy your own private prompt library with custom branding, themes, and authentication.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Quick Start:</strong></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"npx prompts.chat new my-prompt-library\ncd my-prompt-library\"><pre>npx prompts.chat new my-prompt-library\n<span>cd</span> my-prompt-library</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Manual Setup:</strong></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git clone https://github.com/f/prompts.chat.git\ncd prompts.chat\nnpm install && npm run setup\"><pre>git clone https://github.com/f/prompts.chat.git\n<span>cd</span> prompts.chat\nnpm install <span>&amp;&amp;</span> npm run setup</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The setup wizard configures branding, theme, authentication (GitHub/Google/Azure AD), and features.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Recommended database:</strong> prompts.chat uses PostgreSQL. For a hosted database, we recommend <a href=\"https://get.neon.com/VqfnMo4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neon</a>.</p>\n<div dir=\"auto\">\n  <p dir=\"auto\">Sponsored by</p>\n  <a href=\"https://get.neon.com/VqfnMo4\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/neon-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/neon.svg\">\n      <img width=\"250px\" alt=\"Neon Logo fallback\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/neon-dark.svg\">\n    </picture></themed-picture>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">📖 <strong><a href=\"/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/SELF-HOSTING.md\">Full Self-Hosting Guide</a></strong> • 🐳 <strong><a href=\"/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/DOCKER.md\">Docker Guide</a></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<P dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">🔌 Integrations</h2><a id=\"user-content--integrations\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🔌 Integrations\" href=\"#-integrations\"></a></P>\n<P dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">CLI</h3><a id=\"user-content-cli\" aria-label=\"Permalink: CLI\" href=\"#cli\"></a></P>\n<div dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"npx prompts.chat\"><pre>npx prompts.chat</pre></div>\n<P dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Claude Code Plugin</h3><a id=\"user-content-claude-code-plugin\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Claude Code Plugin\" href=\"#claude-code-plugin\"></a></P>\n<div data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"/plugin marketplace add f/prompts.chat\n/plugin install prompts.chat@prompts.chat\"><pre><code>/plugin marketplace add f/prompts.chat\n/plugin install prompts.chat@prompts.chat\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">📖 <a href=\"/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/CLAUDE-PLUGIN.md\">Plugin Documentation</a></p>\n<P dir=\"auto\"><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">MCP Server</h3><a id=\"user-content-mcp-server\" aria-label=\"Permalink: MCP Server\" href=\"#mcp-server\"></a></P>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Use prompts.chat as an MCP server in your AI tools.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Remote (recommended):</strong></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;prompts.chat&quot;: {\n      &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://prompts.chat/api/mcp&quot;\n    }\n  }\n}\"><pre>{\n  <span>\"mcpServers\"</span>: {\n    <span>\"prompts.chat\"</span>: {\n      <span>\"url\"</span>: <span><span>\"</span>https://prompts.chat/api/mcp<span>\"</span></span>\n    }\n  }\n}</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Local:</strong></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;prompts.chat&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [&quot;-y&quot;, &quot;prompts.chat&quot;, &quot;mcp&quot;]\n    }\n  }\n}\"><pre>{\n  <span>\"mcpServers\"</span>: {\n    <span>\"prompts.chat\"</span>: {\n      <span>\"command\"</span>: <span><span>\"</span>npx<span>\"</span></span>,\n      <span>\"args\"</span>: [<span><span>\"</span>-y<span>\"</span></span>, <span><span>\"</span>prompts.chat<span>\"</span></span>, <span><span>\"</span>mcp<span>\"</span></span>]\n    }\n  }\n}</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">📖 <a href=\"https://prompts.chat/docs/api\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCP Documentation</a></p>\n<hr>\n<P dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">💖 Sponsors</h2><a id=\"user-content--sponsors\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 💖 Sponsors\" href=\"#-sponsors\"></a></P>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\n  \n  <a href=\"https://get.neon.com/VqfnMo4\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/neon-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/neon.svg\">\n      <img height=\"30\" alt=\"Neon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/neon.svg\">\n    </picture></themed-picture>\n  </a>&#160;&#160;\n  \n  <a href=\"https://clemta.com/?utm_source=prompts.chat\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/clemta-dark.webp\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/clemta.webp\">\n      <img height=\"35\" alt=\"Clemta\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/clemta.webp\">\n    </picture></themed-picture>\n  </a>&#160;&#160;\n  \n  <a href=\"https://wiro.ai/?utm_source=prompts.chat\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img height=\"30\" alt=\"Wiro\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/wiro.png\">\n  </a>&#160;&#160;\n  \n  <a href=\"https://wind.surf/prompts-chat\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/cognition-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/cognition.svg\">\n      <img height=\"35\" alt=\"Cognition\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/cognition.svg\">\n    </picture></themed-picture>\n  </a>&#160;&#160;\n  \n  <a href=\"https://coderabbit.link/fatih\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/coderabbit-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/coderabbit.svg\">\n      <img height=\"30\" alt=\"CodeRabbit\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/coderabbit.svg\">\n    </picture></themed-picture>\n  </a>&#160;&#160;\n  \n  <a href=\"https://sentry.io/?utm_source=prompts.chat\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/sentry-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/sentry.svg\">\n      <img height=\"30\" alt=\"Sentry\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/sentry.svg\">\n    </picture></themed-picture>\n  </a>&#160;&#160;\n  \n  <a href=\"https://www.eachlabs.ai/?utm_source=promptschat&utm_medium=referral\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/eachlabs-dark.png\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/eachlabs.png\">\n      <img height=\"28\" alt=\"Each Labs\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/eachlabs.png\">\n    </picture></themed-picture>\n  </a>&#160;&#160;\n  \n  <a href=\"https://commandcode.ai/?utm_source=prompts.chat\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/commandcode-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/commandcode.svg\">\n      <img height=\"30\" alt=\"CommandCode\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/commandcode.svg\">\n    </picture></themed-picture>\n  </a>\n</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\n  <sub>Built with <a href=\"https://wind.surf/prompts-chat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Windsurf</a> and <a href=\"https://devin.ai\" rel=\"nofollow\">Devin</a></sub><br>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/f/sponsorships?sponsor=f&tier_id=558224&preview=false\"><strong>Become a Sponsor →</strong></a>\n</p>\n<hr>\n<P dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">👥 Contributors</h2><a id=\"user-content--contributors\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 👥 Contributors\" href=\"#-contributors\"></a></P>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/f/prompts.chat/graphs/contributors\">\n  <img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/0870992c8f684b4c33b41319a3bec2ad2868397af481a3ad1b1c8d6894376405/68747470733a2f2f636f6e747269622e726f636b732f696d6167653f7265706f3d662f70726f6d7074732e63686174\" data-canonical-src=\"https://contrib.rocks/image?repo=f/prompts.chat\">\n</a>\n<hr>\n<P dir=\"auto\"><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">📜 License</h2><a id=\"user-content--license\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 📜 License\" href=\"#-license\"></a></P>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This project is dual-licensed:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Source code and site-authored content</strong> is licensed under the <a href=\"/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/LICENSE-MIT\">MIT License</a>,\nincluding the interactive book content in <a href=\"/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/src/content/book\"><code>src/content/book</code></a>.</li>\n<li><strong>Prompt content and data</strong> (prompts.csv, PROMPTS.md, user-submitted prompts) is dedicated to the public domain under <a href=\"/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/LICENSE-CC0\">CC0 1.0 Universal</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See <a href=\"/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/LICENSE\">LICENSE</a> for details.</p>\n</article></div></DIV>","content_text":"The world's largest open-source prompt library for AI Works with ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Llama, Mistral, and more formerly known as Awesome ChatGPT Prompts 🌐 Browse Prompts • 📖 Read the Book • 📄 View on GitHub • 🚀 Self-Host 🏆 Featured in Forbes · 🎓 Referenced by Harvard, Columbia · 📄 40+ academic citations · ❤️ Most liked dataset on Hugging Face ⭐ 143k+ GitHub stars · 🏅 GitHub Staff Pick · 🚀 First prompt library (Dec 2022) Loved by AI pioneers: Greg Brockman (OpenAI Co-Founder) · Wojciech Zaremba (OpenAI Co-Founder) · Clement Delangue (Hugging Face CEO) · Thomas Dohmke (Former GitHub CEO) What is this? A curated collection of prompts for AI chat models. Originally created for ChatGPT, these prompts work great with any modern AI assistant. Browse Prompts Data Formats prompts.chat prompts.csv PROMPTS.md Hugging Face Dataset Want to contribute? Add prompts at prompts.chat/prompts/new — they sync here automatically. 📖 The Interactive Book of Prompting Learn prompt engineering with our free, interactive guide — 25+ chapters covering everything from basics to advanced techniques like chain-of-thought reasoning, few-shot learning, and AI agents. Start Reading → (Source: https://github.com/f/prompts.chat/tree/main/src/content/book) 🎮 Prompting for Kids An interactive, game-based adventure to teach children (ages 8-14) how to communicate with AI through fun puzzles and stories. Start Playing → 🚀 Self-Hosting Deploy your own private prompt library with custom branding, themes, and authentication. Quick Start: npx prompts.chat new my-prompt-library cd my-prompt-library Manual Setup: git clone https://github.com/f/prompts.chat.git cd prompts.chat npm install && npm run setup The setup wizard configures branding, theme, authentication (GitHub/Google/Azure AD), and features. Recommended database: prompts.chat uses PostgreSQL. For a hosted database, we recommend Neon. Sponsored by 📖 Full Self-Hosting Guide • 🐳 Docker Guide 🔌 Integrations CLI npx prompts.chat Claude Code Plugin /plugin marketplace add f/prompts.chat /plugin install prompts.chat@prompts.chat 📖 Plugin Documentation MCP Server Use prompts.chat as an MCP server in your AI tools. Remote (recommended): { \"mcpServers\": { \"prompts.chat\": { \"url\": \"https://prompts.chat/api/mcp\" } } } Local: { \"mcpServers\": { \"prompts.chat\": { \"command\": \"npx\", \"args\": [\"-y\", \"prompts.chat\", \"mcp\"] } } } 📖 MCP Documentation 💖 Sponsors Built with Windsurf and Devin Become a Sponsor → 👥 Contributors 📜 License This project is dual-licensed: Source code and site-authored content is licensed under the MIT License, including the interactive book content in src/content/book. Prompt content and data (prompts.csv, PROMPTS.md, user-submitted prompts) is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal. See LICENSE for details.","fetched_at":"2026-09-04T12:06:58.475Z","ok":true,"blocks":[{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">\n  <strong>The world's largest open-source prompt library for AI</strong><br>\n  <sub>Works with ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Llama, Mistral, and more</sub>\n</p>","sentences":[{"en":"The world's largest open-source prompt library for AI Works with ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Llama, Mistral, and more","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">\n  <sub>formerly known as Awesome ChatGPT Prompts</sub>\n</p>","sentences":[{"en":"formerly known as Awesome ChatGPT Prompts","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">\n  <a href=\"https://prompts.chat/prompts\" rel=\"nofollow\">🌐 Browse Prompts</a> •\n  <a href=\"https://fka.gumroad.com/l/art-of-chatgpt-prompting\" rel=\"nofollow\">📖 Read the Book</a> •\n  <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/PROMPTS.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">📄 View on GitHub</a> •\n  <a href=\"#-self-hosting\">🚀 Self-Host</a>\n</p>","sentences":[{"en":"🌐 Browse Prompts • 📖 Read the Book • 📄 View on GitHub • 🚀 Self-Host","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">\n  <sub>\n    🏆 Featured in <a href=\"https://www.forbes.com/sites/tjmccue/2023/01/19/chatgpt-success-completely-depends-on-your-prompt/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forbes</a> ·\n    🎓 Referenced by <a href=\"https://www.huit.harvard.edu/news/ai-prompts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Harvard</a>, <a href=\"https://etc.cuit.columbia.edu/news/columbia-prompt-library-effective-academic-ai-use\" rel=\"nofollow\">Columbia</a> ·\n    📄 <a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=AZ0Dg8YAAAAJ&hl=en\" rel=\"nofollow\">40+ academic citations</a> ·\n    ❤️ <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/fka/prompts.chat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Most liked dataset</a> on Hugging Face<br>\n    ⭐ 143k+ GitHub stars ·\n    🏅 <a href=\"https://spotlights-feed.github.com/spotlights/prompts-chat/index/\">GitHub Staff Pick</a> ·\n    🚀 First prompt library (Dec 2022)\n  </sub>\n</p>","sentences":[{"en":"🏆 Featured in Forbes · 🎓 Referenced by Harvard, Columbia · 📄 40+ academic citations · ❤️ Most liked dataset on Hugging Face ⭐ 143k+ GitHub stars · 🏅 GitHub Staff Pick · 🚀 First prompt library (Dec 2022)","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">\n  <sub><strong>Loved by AI pioneers:</strong></sub><br>\n  <sub>\n    <a href=\"https://x.com/gdb/status/1602072566671110144\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Greg Brockman</strong></a> (OpenAI Co-Founder) ·\n    <a href=\"https://x.com/woj_zaremba/status/1601362952841760769\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Wojciech Zaremba</strong></a> (OpenAI Co-Founder) ·\n    <a href=\"https://x.com/clementdelangue/status/1830976369389642059\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Clement Delangue</strong></a> (Hugging Face CEO) ·\n    <a href=\"https://x.com/ashtom/status/1887250944427237816\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Thomas Dohmke</strong></a> (Former GitHub CEO)\n  </sub>\n</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Loved by AI pioneers: Greg Brockman (OpenAI Co-Founder) · Wojciech Zaremba (OpenAI Co-Founder) · Clement Delangue (Hugging Face CEO) · Thomas Dohmke (Former GitHub CEO)","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">What is this?</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"What is this?","zh":"这是什么？"}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">A curated collection of <strong>prompts</strong> for AI chat models. Originally created for ChatGPT, these prompts work great with any modern AI assistant.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"A curated collection of prompts for AI chat models.","zh":null},{"en":"Originally created for ChatGPT, these prompts work great with any modern AI assistant.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<th>Browse Prompts</th>","sentences":[{"en":"Browse Prompts","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<th>Data Formats</th>","sentences":[{"en":"Data Formats","zh":"数据格式"}]},{"html_en":"<td><a href=\"https://prompts.chat/prompts\" rel=\"nofollow\">prompts.chat</a></td>","sentences":[{"en":"prompts.chat","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><a href=\"/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/prompts.csv\">prompts.csv</a></td>","sentences":[{"en":"prompts.csv","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/PROMPTS.md\" rel=\"nofollow\">PROMPTS.md</a></td>","sentences":[{"en":"PROMPTS.md","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<td><a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/fka/prompts.chat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hugging Face Dataset</a></td>","sentences":[{"en":"Hugging Face Dataset","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Want to contribute?</strong> Add prompts at <a href=\"https://prompts.chat/prompts/new\" rel=\"nofollow\">prompts.chat/prompts/new</a> — they sync here automatically.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Want to contribute?","zh":null},{"en":"Add prompts at prompts.chat/prompts/new — they sync here automatically.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">📖 The Interactive Book of Prompting</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"📖 The Interactive Book of Prompting","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">Learn prompt engineering with our <strong>free, interactive guide</strong> — 25+ chapters covering everything from basics to advanced techniques like chain-of-thought reasoning, few-shot learning, and AI agents.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Learn prompt engineering with our free, interactive guide — 25+ chapters covering everything from basics to advanced techniques like chain-of-thought reasoning, few-shot learning, and AI agents.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\"><strong><a href=\"https://fka.gumroad.com/l/art-of-chatgpt-prompting\" rel=\"nofollow\">Start Reading →</a></strong> (Source: <a href=\"https://github.com/f/prompts.chat/tree/main/src/content/book\">https://github.com/f/prompts.chat/tree/main/src/content/book</a>)</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Start Reading → (Source: https://github.com/f/prompts.chat/tree/main/src/content/book)","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">🎮 Prompting for Kids</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"🎮 Prompting for Kids","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">An interactive, game-based adventure to teach children (ages 8-14) how to communicate with AI through fun puzzles and stories.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"An interactive, game-based adventure to teach children (ages 8-14) how to communicate with AI through fun puzzles and stories.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\"><strong><a href=\"https://prompts.chat/kids\" rel=\"nofollow\">Start Playing →</a></strong></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Start Playing →","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">🚀 Self-Hosting</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"🚀 Self-Hosting","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">Deploy your own private prompt library with custom branding, themes, and authentication.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Deploy your own private prompt library with custom branding, themes, and authentication.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Quick Start:</strong></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Quick Start:","zh":"快速入门："}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Manual Setup:</strong></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Manual Setup:","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">The setup wizard configures branding, theme, authentication (GitHub/Google/Azure AD), and features.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"The setup wizard configures branding, theme, authentication (GitHub/Google/Azure AD), and features.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Recommended database:</strong> prompts.chat uses PostgreSQL. For a hosted database, we recommend <a href=\"https://get.neon.com/VqfnMo4\" rel=\"nofollow\">Neon</a>.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Recommended database: prompts.chat uses PostgreSQL.","zh":null},{"en":"For a hosted database, we recommend Neon.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">Sponsored by</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Sponsored by","zh":"赞助商"}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">📖 <strong><a href=\"/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/SELF-HOSTING.md\">Full Self-Hosting Guide</a></strong> • 🐳 <strong><a href=\"/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/DOCKER.md\">Docker Guide</a></strong></p>","sentences":[{"en":"📖 Full Self-Hosting Guide • 🐳 Docker Guide","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">🔌 Integrations</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"🔌 Integrations","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h3 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">CLI</h3>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<h3 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">Claude Code Plugin</h3>","sentences":[{"en":"Claude Code Plugin","zh":"克劳德代码插件"}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">📖 <a href=\"/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/CLAUDE-PLUGIN.md\">Plugin Documentation</a></p>","sentences":[{"en":"📖 Plugin Documentation","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h3 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">MCP Server</h3>","sentences":[{"en":"MCP Server","zh":"MCP服务器"}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">Use prompts.chat as an MCP server in your AI tools.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Use prompts.chat as an MCP server in your AI tools.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Remote (recommended):</strong></p>","sentences":[{"en":"Remote (recommended):","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Local:</strong></p>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">📖 <a href=\"https://prompts.chat/docs/api\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCP Documentation</a></p>","sentences":[{"en":"📖 MCP Documentation","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">💖 Sponsors</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"💖 Sponsors","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">\n  <sub>Built with <a href=\"https://wind.surf/prompts-chat\" rel=\"nofollow\">Windsurf</a> and <a href=\"https://devin.ai\" rel=\"nofollow\">Devin</a></sub><br>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/f/sponsorships?sponsor=f&tier_id=558224&preview=false\"><strong>Become a Sponsor →</strong></a>\n</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Built with Windsurf and Devin Become a Sponsor →","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">👥 Contributors</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"👥 Contributors","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">📜 License</h2>","sentences":[{"en":"📜 License","zh":"📜 许可证"}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">This project is dual-licensed:</p>","sentences":[{"en":"This project is dual-licensed:","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li><strong>Source code and site-authored content</strong> is licensed under the <a href=\"/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/LICENSE-MIT\">MIT License</a>,\nincluding the interactive book content in <a href=\"/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/src/content/book\"><code>src/content/book</code></a>.</li>","sentences":[{"en":"Source code and site-authored content is licensed under the MIT License, including the interactive book content in src/content/book.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<li><strong>Prompt content and data</strong> (prompts.csv, PROMPTS.md, user-submitted prompts) is dedicated to the public domain under <a href=\"/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/LICENSE-CC0\">CC0 1.0 Universal</a>.</li>","sentences":[{"en":"Prompt content and data (prompts.csv, PROMPTS.md, user-submitted prompts) is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p dir=\"auto\">See <a href=\"/f/prompts.chat/blob/main/LICENSE\">LICENSE</a> for details.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"See LICENSE for details.","zh":"有关详细信息，请参阅许可证。"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div data-hpc=\"true\" containertiming=\"hpc\"><article itemprop=\"text\">\n<p dir=\"auto\">The world's largest open-source prompt library for AI Works with ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini, Llama, Mistral, and more</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">formerly known as Awesome ChatGPT Prompts</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\n  <a href=\"https://prompts.chat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/6d224fb190943a3370370b00dc8a45e4a453a0dc6c7298fb8e01f020a4900d77/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f576562736974652d70726f6d7074732e636861742d626c75653f7374796c653d666c61742d737175617265\" alt=\"Website\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Website-prompts.chat-blue?style=flat-square\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/sindresorhus/awesome\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/2727609d8bfde9ba1a95be1449eb878bfafa4d76789ba05661857e2c8ac70fa1/68747470733a2f2f63646e2e7261776769742e636f6d2f73696e647265736f726875732f617765736f6d652f643733303566333864323966656437386661383536353265336136336531353464643865383832392f6d656469612f62616467652e737667\" alt=\"Awesome\" data-canonical-src=\"https://cdn.rawgit.com/sindresorhus/awesome/d7305f38d29fed78fa85652e3a63e154dd8e8829/media/badge.svg\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/fka/prompts.chat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/d505c7f3038232a64d9a86a08b1821062924d91cdbe7a913f152131ab6871c0b/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652ff09fa4972d48756767696e675f466163652d79656c6c6f773f7374796c653d666c61742d737175617265\" alt=\"Hugging Face\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/🤗-Hugging_Face-yellow?style=flat-square\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://deepwiki.com/f/prompts.chat\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/0f5ae213ac378635adeb5d7f13cef055ad2f7d9a47b36de7b1c67dbe09f609ca/68747470733a2f2f6465657077696b692e636f6d2f62616467652e737667\" alt=\"Ask DeepWiki\" data-canonical-src=\"https://deepwiki.com/badge.svg\"></a>\n</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">🌐 Browse Prompts • 📖 Read the Book • 📄 View on GitHub • 🚀 Self-Host</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">🏆 Featured in Forbes · 🎓 Referenced by Harvard, Columbia · 📄 40+ academic citations · ❤️ Most liked dataset on Hugging Face ⭐ 143k+ GitHub stars · 🏅 GitHub Staff Pick · 🚀 First prompt library (Dec 2022)</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Loved by AI pioneers: Greg Brockman (OpenAI Co-Founder) · Wojciech Zaremba (OpenAI Co-Founder) · Clement Delangue (Hugging Face CEO) · Thomas Dohmke (Former GitHub CEO)</p>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">这是什么？</h2><a id=\"user-content-what-is-this\" aria-label=\"Permalink: What is this?\" href=\"#what-is-this\"></a><p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A curated collection of prompts for AI chat models. Originally created for ChatGPT, these prompts work great with any modern AI assistant.</p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Browse Prompts</th>\n<th>数据格式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>prompts.chat</td>\n<td>prompts.csv</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PROMPTS.md</td>\n<td>Hugging Face Dataset</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Want to contribute? Add prompts at prompts.chat/prompts/new — they sync here automatically.</p>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">📖 The Interactive Book of Prompting</h2><a id=\"user-content--the-interactive-book-of-prompting\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 📖 The Interactive Book of Prompting\" href=\"#-the-interactive-book-of-prompting\"></a><p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Learn prompt engineering with our free, interactive guide — 25+ chapters covering everything from basics to advanced techniques like chain-of-thought reasoning, few-shot learning, and AI agents.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Start Reading → (Source: https://github.com/f/prompts.chat/tree/main/src/content/book)</p>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">🎮 Prompting for Kids</h2><a id=\"user-content--prompting-for-kids\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🎮 Prompting for Kids\" href=\"#-prompting-for-kids\"></a><p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\n  <a href=\"https://prompts.chat/kids\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/38cd8206b43f9f14da823fb5fd45778bd888034c9781acd4d6a98cf69d2e0942/68747470733a2f2f70726f6d7074732e636861742f70726f6d692d6461726b2e737667\" data-canonical-src=\"https://prompts.chat/promi-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/143e166576e09647ecd41e1c79ed2df3e70347b7a14f747cb8ed82e2604efcd0/68747470733a2f2f70726f6d7074732e636861742f70726f6d692e737667\" data-canonical-src=\"https://prompts.chat/promi.svg\">\n      <img height=\"60\" alt=\"Promi\" src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/143e166576e09647ecd41e1c79ed2df3e70347b7a14f747cb8ed82e2604efcd0/68747470733a2f2f70726f6d7074732e636861742f70726f6d692e737667\" data-canonical-src=\"https://prompts.chat/promi.svg\">\n    </picture></themed-picture>\n  </a>\n</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">An interactive, game-based adventure to teach children (ages 8-14) how to communicate with AI through fun puzzles and stories.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Start Playing →</p>\n<br clear=\"left\">\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">🚀 Self-Hosting</h2><a id=\"user-content--self-hosting\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🚀 Self-Hosting\" href=\"#-self-hosting\"></a><p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Deploy your own private prompt library with custom branding, themes, and authentication.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">快速入门：</p>\n<div dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"npx prompts.chat new my-prompt-library\ncd my-prompt-library\"><pre>npx prompts.chat new my-prompt-library\n<span>cd</span> my-prompt-library</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Manual Setup:</p>\n<div dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git clone https://github.com/f/prompts.chat.git\ncd prompts.chat\nnpm install && npm run setup\"><pre>git clone https://github.com/f/prompts.chat.git\n<span>cd</span> prompts.chat\nnpm install <span>&amp;&amp;</span> npm run setup</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The setup wizard configures branding, theme, authentication (GitHub/Google/Azure AD), and features.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Recommended database: prompts.chat uses PostgreSQL. For a hosted database, we recommend Neon.</p>\n<div dir=\"auto\">\n  <p dir=\"auto\">赞助商</p>\n  <a href=\"https://get.neon.com/VqfnMo4\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/neon-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/neon.svg\">\n      <img width=\"250px\" alt=\"Neon Logo fallback\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/neon-dark.svg\">\n    </picture></themed-picture>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">📖 Full Self-Hosting Guide • 🐳 Docker Guide</p>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">🔌 Integrations</h2><a id=\"user-content--integrations\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 🔌 Integrations\" href=\"#-integrations\"></a><p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">CLI</h3><a id=\"user-content-cli\" aria-label=\"Permalink: CLI\" href=\"#cli\"></a><p></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"npx prompts.chat\"><pre>npx prompts.chat</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">克劳德代码插件</h3><a id=\"user-content-claude-code-plugin\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Claude Code Plugin\" href=\"#claude-code-plugin\"></a><p></p>\n<div data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"/plugin marketplace add f/prompts.chat\n/plugin install prompts.chat@prompts.chat\"><pre><code>/plugin marketplace add f/prompts.chat\n/plugin install prompts.chat@prompts.chat\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">📖 Plugin Documentation</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h3 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">MCP服务器</h3><a id=\"user-content-mcp-server\" aria-label=\"Permalink: MCP Server\" href=\"#mcp-server\"></a><p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Use prompts.chat as an MCP server in your AI tools.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Remote (recommended):</p>\n<div dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;prompts.chat&quot;: {\n      &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://prompts.chat/api/mcp&quot;\n    }\n  }\n}\"><pre>{\n  <span>\"mcpServers\"</span>: {\n    <span>\"prompts.chat\"</span>: {\n      <span>\"url\"</span>: <span><span>\"</span>https://prompts.chat/api/mcp<span>\"</span></span>\n    }\n  }\n}</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Local:</strong></p>\n<div dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"{\n  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {\n    &quot;prompts.chat&quot;: {\n      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,\n      &quot;args&quot;: [&quot;-y&quot;, &quot;prompts.chat&quot;, &quot;mcp&quot;]\n    }\n  }\n}\"><pre>{\n  <span>\"mcpServers\"</span>: {\n    <span>\"prompts.chat\"</span>: {\n      <span>\"command\"</span>: <span><span>\"</span>npx<span>\"</span></span>,\n      <span>\"args\"</span>: [<span><span>\"</span>-y<span>\"</span></span>, <span><span>\"</span>prompts.chat<span>\"</span></span>, <span><span>\"</span>mcp<span>\"</span></span>]\n    }\n  }\n}</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">📖 MCP Documentation</p>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"></p><h2 tabindex=\"-1\" dir=\"auto\">💖 Sponsors</h2><a id=\"user-content--sponsors\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 💖 Sponsors\" href=\"#-sponsors\"></a><p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\n  \n  <a href=\"https://get.neon.com/VqfnMo4\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/neon-dark.svg\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/neon.svg\">\n      <img height=\"30\" alt=\"Neon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/neon.svg\">\n    </picture></themed-picture>\n  </a>&#160;&#160;\n  \n  <a href=\"https://clemta.com/?utm_source=prompts.chat\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture>\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/clemta-dark.webp\">\n      <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/f/prompts.chat/main/public/sponsors/clemta.webp\">\n      <img height=\"35\" alt=\"Clemta\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/